WEBVTT

00:10:57.708 --> 00:11:00.066
(Skratt)

00:11:00.456 --> 00:11:04.574
Vecka 3, kändisar - 
Entertainment Tonight,

00:11:04.574 --> 00:11:06.880
Access Hollywood.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:12.686
Vecka 4, globalt - BBC, irländsk radio.

00:11:13.106 --> 00:11:15.731
Såg någon "Lost in Translation"?

00:11:15.731 --> 00:11:19.773
Min man var med i japansk TV,
det var intressant.

00:11:19.783 --> 00:11:21.752
(Skratt)

00:11:21.752 --> 00:11:26.724
Och alla videos, de populära.

00:11:28.494 --> 00:11:31.836
Paul Bissonnettes glaciärvideo, otrolig.